        "steam_appid": 3843120,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/04bf27db9c8cb6583e70749c93dfbe59.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Valiants: Arena!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Arena, Tamer! Face off against other players with your team of 4 Valiants in strategic <strong>2v2</strong> battles. Swap your Valiants mid-battle and adapt your strategy in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/fc71e1dedddfee175f730c1e2998f74d.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical and Dynamic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch your Valiants in battle and adjust your strategy as you go. But it might not be that easy with our Stage system. Winning? The arena might decide to make things harder for you. Losing? Maybe it’ll throw you a lifeline. Every turn is a plot twist. Every match tells a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/49046b9f1f3c1e0c44d64c20a4afa3ff.poster.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/49046b9f1f3c1e0c44d64c20a4afa3ff.webm?t=1760639091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/49046b9f1f3c1e0c44d64c20a4afa3ff.mp4?t=1760639091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Valiant has a role (<strong>Tank, Attack, or Support</strong>) and one or two elemental affinities (<strong>Fire, Water, Earth, Ice, Wind, and Grass</strong>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/5e9709e01b319fcfd44e79cc5410ccd5.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose the Best Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice of Skill Cards is just as important as your Valiants. Pick the right abilities, combine them with elemental affinities, and unleash powerful effects to outplay your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/769ecee9d4b25aef37fe28c7b1f4afe2.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Valiant is Unique</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from multiple Valiants and customize their arsenal with different Skill Cards and Accessories to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/b569b788241b5fbf6b5688d02f88c10d.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are the Tamer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind every great team, there’s a great leader. The Tamer is a key element in battle—choose between different skins and equip abilities that optimize your strategy and secure your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/9b6579ca5cfc3b1c7edf8402b84a81ed.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prove You’re the Best</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to master. Valiants: Arena offers an accessible experience with enough depth to challenge even the most skilled players. Climb the ranks through the division system, compete in regular tournaments, and prove you have what it takes to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/5e3f6795d854097cc1e8e2ed4f99b0c0.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/04bf27db9c8cb6583e70749c93dfbe59.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Valiants: Arena!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Arena, Tamer! Face off against other players with your team of 4 Valiants in strategic <strong>2v2</strong> battles. Swap your Valiants mid-battle and adapt your strategy in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/fc71e1dedddfee175f730c1e2998f74d.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical and Dynamic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch your Valiants in battle and adjust your strategy as you go. But it might not be that easy with our Stage system. Winning? The arena might decide to make things harder for you. Losing? Maybe it’ll throw you a lifeline. Every turn is a plot twist. Every match tells a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/49046b9f1f3c1e0c44d64c20a4afa3ff.poster.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/49046b9f1f3c1e0c44d64c20a4afa3ff.webm?t=1760639091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/49046b9f1f3c1e0c44d64c20a4afa3ff.mp4?t=1760639091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Valiant has a role (<strong>Tank, Attack, or Support</strong>) and one or two elemental affinities (<strong>Fire, Water, Earth, Ice, Wind, and Grass</strong>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/5e9709e01b319fcfd44e79cc5410ccd5.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose the Best Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice of Skill Cards is just as important as your Valiants. Pick the right abilities, combine them with elemental affinities, and unleash powerful effects to outplay your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/769ecee9d4b25aef37fe28c7b1f4afe2.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Valiant is Unique</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from multiple Valiants and customize their arsenal with different Skill Cards and Accessories to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/b569b788241b5fbf6b5688d02f88c10d.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are the Tamer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind every great team, there’s a great leader. The Tamer is a key element in battle—choose between different skins and equip abilities that optimize your strategy and secure your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/9b6579ca5cfc3b1c7edf8402b84a81ed.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prove You’re the Best</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to master. Valiants: Arena offers an accessible experience with enough depth to challenge even the most skilled players. Climb the ranks through the division system, compete in regular tournaments, and prove you have what it takes to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843120/extras/5e3f6795d854097cc1e8e2ed4f99b0c0.avif?t=1760639091\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Each card is a possibility. Each move, a step toward victory. Collect, combine and unleash the elemental power of your Valiants in intense turn-based battles. Can you conquer the arena and become the ultimate Tamer?",
